mpany's property portfolio includes townships, shopping malls, hotels and resorts, and high-rise residences, as well as a factory/warehouse. It also develops residential and commercial properties, including land homes, condominiums, retail shop offices; invests in real properties; operates hotels and malls; and operates and manages car parks. In addition, the company offers management services; wellness and health care related products and services; and food and beverage related products and services. KSL Holdings Berhad was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Segamat, Malaysia.","zh":"KSL Holdings Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事房地产开发业务。公司成立于2000年，总部位于马来西亚昔加末。公司通过四个分部运营：房地产开发、房地产投资、投资控股和停车场运营。","lines":["房地产开发：开发住宅和商业物业，包括土地住宅、公寓、零售店铺办公室，客户为购房者和企业。","房地产投资：投资于房地产物业，包括乡镇、购物中心、酒店和度假村、高层住宅以及工厂/仓库。","酒店和商场运营：运营酒店和购物中心，客户为旅客和购物者。","停车场运营：运营和管理停车场，客户为驾车者。","其他服务：提供管理服务、健康保健相关产品和服务、以及食品饮料相关产品和服务。"],"lines_en":["Property Development: Develops residential and commercial properties, including land homes, condominiums, and retail shop offices, for homebuyers and businesses.","Property Investment: Invests in real properties, including townships, shopping malls, hotels and resorts, high-rise residences, and a factory/warehouse.","Hotel and Mall Operations: Operates hotels and shopping malls for travelers and shoppers.","Car Park Operation: Operates and manages car parks for drivers.","Other Services: Offers management services, wellness and health care related products and services, and food and beverage related products and services."]}}